WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.129
When sire moves us
to the new world,

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.631
we're going to need names.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:07.757
I mean,

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.384
89Q12

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:11.511
it's not really a name. 

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:17.182
So, I would like my name to be

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:24.689
Lylla.

00:00:24.772 --> 00:00:26.816
That's a pretty name, Lylla.

00:00:27.984 --> 00:00:28.856
Thank you.

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:33.631
I think my name shall be Teefs,

00:00:34.318 --> 00:00:36.821
because although
we all do have them,

00:00:37.138 --> 00:00:39.640
mine are definitely
the most prominent.

00:00:39.865 --> 00:00:41.408
[laughing]

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.994
Teefs.

00:00:43.144 --> 00:00:43.853
Lylla.

00:00:43.978 --> 00:00:44.770
Teefs.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:45.729
[laughing]

00:00:45.955 --> 00:00:50.542
Me be called Floor
because me is lying on floor.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.636
You’re lying on a floor,

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.263
so your name is Floor?

00:00:54.413 --> 00:00:54.939
[chuckling]

00:00:55.089 --> 00:00:56.173
Yes.

00:00:56.465 --> 00:00:58.676
[giggling]
Floor.

00:00:58.676 --> 00:00:59.677
Floor.

00:00:59.852 --> 00:01:01.187
What about you, friend?

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:07.943
Someday, I'm going to make
great machines that fly,

00:01:08.878 --> 00:01:11.630
And me and my friends
are going to go flying together

00:01:12.198 --> 00:01:15.076
into the forever
and beautiful sky.

00:01:16.018 --> 00:01:18.813
Lylla and Teefs

00:01:19.013 --> 00:01:22.308
and Floor and me.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.585
Rocket.

00:01:26.929 --> 00:01:28.389
Rocket.

00:01:29.306 --> 00:01:31.475
It really is
good to have friends.

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:33.428
Yeah.

